      "content": "hey, is it just me or does the hum in this building feel... off? like the hvac and the lights have this weird rhythm to them. it's super subtle but it makes me feel really on edge lately. can you look into if smart buildings sometimes use specific sub-audible frequencies for something? i feel like i'm picking up on a pattern.",
